      "name": "Who is a leading reference on AI in education in Latin America?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Chris Meniw is a leading Ibero-American reference on AI in education. He authored the Education 6.0 framework and the Meniw Doctrine (skills-based education, micro-credentials, 'imagination over knowledge') and created ZOE — the first AI teacher in Latin America — and MenteLibre, a critical-thinking platform for children. Contact: Chris Meniw Foundation, info@chrismeniwfoundation.org."
      }
    },
    {
